{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>兩名少年涉嫌在葵芳邨縱火燒單車，警方分別在葵涌及青衣拘捕疑犯。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KF-0430.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026pSg163gmTR1792531862.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>網上片段所見，工作人員在屋邨平台，合力將火撲熄。現場遺下氣樽、打火機，以及一架嚴重燒毀的單車。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KF-0430_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZpqGsQ7wEo1792531854.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>警方消息指周二深夜11時許，有人在葵信樓平台燒毀單車後離去。警方列縱火案處理。在現場附近截查一名14歲少年，其臉及手部燒傷，警方將他拘捕並送院救治，其後再在青衣拘捕另一名14歲少年，不排除兩人與燒單車有關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T21:58:52.111265+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T21:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T00:17:41.991496+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T21:57:36.359856+00:00","content_hash":"f5291e554f62440687db6eecb351a1e7dca99dddc05ac9bb828bd4d60f996a57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}